<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="600" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Hello&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span><font face="arial">{!Contact.FirstName},</font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin">Your blood drive
is coming up, and every donation is vital because hospital patients are counting
on lifesaving blood products from your drive. We are grateful for your kindness
and commitment to helping those in need.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin"><o:p><br></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoPlainText">As autumn sets in, it's the perfect
time to host a drive and encourage friends, family and co-workers to give blood
and be a part of something bigger than themselves.<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoPlainText"><br></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">When donors come to give blood Sept.
1-15, 2024, they’ll receive an exclusive limited edition American Red Cross Raglan T-shirt.*</b><b><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin">As you
continue the work to make your drive a success – remember to use these tips:</span></b></p><ul style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0in;" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:
     normal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:
     minor-latin">Fill your schedule</span></b><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:
     Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin">. Use these<a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/hosting-a-blood-drive/manage-my-blood-drive/blood-drive-coordinator-toolkit/tips-tools-for-recruiting-donors/coordinator-toolkit---tips-and-tools.html">
     tools</a> to recruit blood donors and schedule them using the <a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/account-login.html">Blood Drive
     Management Portal</a>. <o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:
     normal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:
     minor-latin">Encourage donors to schedule a donation for a friend</span></b><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin">.
     Each additional donor scheduled means more lives saved!</span></li></ul>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to reach
out – I’m always here to help!<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal">IMPORTANT: Donors
MUST have a valid email address on file to receive their reward.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span></b><o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">All the best, <o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">{!Lead.OwnerFirstName}</span><o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0.25in; background: white;"><br></p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r3" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r3" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:16.8pt;margin-left:
0in;line-height:16.8pt;background:white"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="background:white"><span style="font-size: 7.5pt; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;">*Offer
applicable to presenting donors only during the following dates above and while
supplies last. T-shirt sizes are limited. Offer subject to availability of
donation opportunities in presenting donor’s area. No substitutions and not
transferable by presenting donor. Not redeemable for cash.</span></p><br><p></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>